BO_ 500 RADAR_STATUS_1f4: 16 RADAR

CM_ "MG4 radar/ADAS domain, BUS 1. Reverse-engineered STRUCTURE only from logs (route 73d49d6e14131585). RADAR_OBJ_00..19 (0x0b0-0x0d6, 64B, 15Hz) are per-object radar tracks. Payload (bytes 4-61) is densely BIT-PACKED, non-byte-aligned object data (range/azimuth/velocity/RCS/valid) and is NOT decoded -- needs a controlled capture (approach a stationary object at known distances) or radar firmware to resolve fields. Framing IS verified: byte3 low nibble = rolling counter (0-15), bytes 0-1 = checksum. The camera-firmware radar.json (IDs 0x300-0x3b1 / CANFD 0x340-0x34f) does NOT match this radar -- different platform, no ID overlap.";
CM_ SG_ 176 RadarCounter "per-frame rolling counter, verified increments 0-15";
